left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.6em 0.6em 0.6em\"><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>This equation does not have any solutions since its left-hand side is always nonnegative, while the right-hand side is negative.</p>\n<p>Therefore, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"50\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> has no roots.</p>\n</div></div>",
